pokeplatinum-route4.patch (tools/pokeplat_gen.py applies it to build/pokeplatinum): the interaction sweep's script log. script_manager.c
ScriptContext_LoadAndStart (every script a context loads: a talk, a sign, a hidden item, a trigger tile, a trainer's sight, a map's arrival
script, a script a script starts) calls PortRoute4_ScriptStart(scriptID) (port/game/route_gen4.c), which logs the id while the sweep's
BWPORT_PT_INT is set (tools/pt_int_sweep.py); it does nothing else. No game behaviour changes; the DS build never sees the patch.
Handover-ID: none (port-only)

